Z||000000||FieroWife||10-29-2000||11:58 AM||||We are starting the design process for the 2001 PFF calendar.  I have a really cool idea for the front cover, but I need your help.  I want to list as many Forum member names as I possibly can.  I realize that there probably aren't really 1400 members that post often.  But, I didn't want to randomly pull names from the past few months, as if I missed some, feelings would be hurt.  So here is what I propose...<P>Please send me an email with your <B>Forum name</B> in the subject line if you'd like to be included in the list of names on the front cover.  This in no way obligates you to buy a calendar or participate in any other way. Please don't just resond to this thread as I don't want Cliff mad at me for creating a huge thread! Cliff, you already have the first slot!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>My e-mail is  <A HREF="mailto:FieroWife@aol.com">FieroWife@aol.com</A> .  I'll include those names submitted to me by November 4, 2000.  <BR>TIA!<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://members.aol.com/fierowife/Signature.gif"> ||||reg||3
